    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
      description : "1.190 AZLX-23-002615"
      info        : "Amazon Linux 2023 must remove all software components after updated versions have been installed.

GROUP ID: V-274185RULE ID: SV-274185r1120543

Previous versions of software components that are not removed from the information system after updates have been installed may be exploited by some adversaries."
      solution    : "Configure Amazon Linux 2023 to remove all software components after updated versions have been installed.

Set the \"clean_requirements_on_remove\" option to \"1\" in the \"/etc/dnf/dnf.conf\" file:

clean_requirements_on_remove=1"
