      solution    : "Configure Amazon Linux 2023 to not allow users to execute privileged actions without authenticating with a password.

Remove any occurrence of \"NOPASSWD\" found in \"/etc/sudoers\" file or files in the \"/etc/sudoers.d\" directory.

