              type            : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
              description     : "offline_credentials_expiration = 1"
              file            : "/etc/sssd/sssd.conf /etc/sssd/conf.d/*"
              regex           : "(?i)^[\\s]*offline_credentials_expiration[\\s]*="
              expect          : "(?i)^[\\s]*offline_credentials_expiration[\\s]*=[\\s]*1[\\s]*$"
              required        : NO
              min_occurrences : "1"
            </custom_item>
          </condition>

          <then>
            <report type:"PASSED">
              description : "1.69 AZLX-23-001305"
              info        : "Amazon Linux 2023 must prohibit the use of cached authenticators after one day.

GROUP ID: V-274062RULE ID: SV-274062r1120174

If cached authentication information is out-of-date, the validity of the authentication information may be questionable."
              solution    : "Configure Amazon Linux 2023 SSSD service to prohibit the use of cached authentications after one day.

Add or change the following line in \"/etc/sssd/sssd.conf\" just below the line [pam]:

offline_credentials_expiration = 1"
